---
title: Which libraries are supported by SumUp?
---

For [Online Payments](/online-payments/introduction/get-started/) we offer a [PHP SDK](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-ecom-php-sdk).

For [card readers](/terminal-payments/introduction/overview/) we have an [Android SDK](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-android-sdk), [iOS SDK](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-ios-sdk), [Android API](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-android-api) and [an iOS API](https://github.com/sumup/sumup-ios-url-scheme).
